  title: Mysterious Figures
  headliner: <b>Plumbers Report Four Mysterious Figures Entering Main Street Sewers</b>
  bodyText: Just hours after municipal crews wrapped up water main repairs along
    Main Street, city plumbers filed an unusual incident report claiming they spotted
    four bulky, hooded figures slipping into an open drainage tunnel carrying stacks
    of takeout pizza boxes and skateboards.
